{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10122020","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10122020","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1012202001:1":{"text":"我们是不是走错路了？这里怎么可能是情人之愿呢？","source_cn":"我们是不是走错路了？这里怎么可能是情人之愿呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2042E786B48DB767","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1012202002:1":{"text":"这么可怕的地方，叫仇人之愿才对吧！地面的腐化竟然比塔兰村还严重……","source_cn":"这么可怕的地方，叫仇人之愿才对吧！地面的腐化竟然比塔兰...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x535C93DC8F9A5292","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012202003:1":{"text":"地脉决定了魔力的流动，它就像错综复杂的河流，难以摸清走势。","source_cn":"地脉决定了魔力的流动，它就像错综复杂的河流，难以摸清走势。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0D2A337BD4B15B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012202004:1":{"text":"看来，这里的地脉与流荧树直接相连，因此受到的影响也更加明显。","source_cn":"看来，这里的地脉与流荧树直接相连，因此受到的影响也更加明显。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFFE6A2DD02C2FFFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012202005:1":{"text":"茴姆婆婆提到的那位伊温小姐呢？情人之愿都变成这样了……她还在吗？","source_cn":"茴姆婆婆提到的那位伊温小姐呢？情人之愿都变成这样了……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69C1FC95FB222F29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","